  "decision_conditions": [
    "<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; line-height: 20px;\">The proposed dwelling, by reason of its siting, scale and proximity to neighbouring boundaries, would result in an increased sense of enclosure and loss of openness to the detriment of neighbouring occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy P3 of the NPPF (2026), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies D12.1, D12.2 and D12.3 of the Merton Local Plan (2024).</div>",
    "<p>Does not comply </p>",
    "Insufficient information has been submitted in respect of energy efficiency, carbon reduction, renewable energy generation, water efficiency and overheating mitigation. As a result, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the development would achieve the required standards of sustainable design or provide acceptable living conditions for future occupiers. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies CC2.1, CC2.2, CC2.3, CC2.4 and CC2.6 of the Merton Local Plan (2024).",
    "In the absence of an Air Quality Assessment, insufficient information has been submitted to demonstrate that the development would achieve Air Quality Neutral status. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy SI1 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy P15.10 of the Merton Local Plan (2024).",
    "<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;; line-height: 20px;\">The proposed dwelling, by reason of its siting, form and use of rear garden land, would create an incongruous form of backland development that would fail to respect the established pattern, character and appearance of the surrounding area. The proposal would erode the spacious rear garden character and represent an unsympathetic form of development. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policies HO1, L1 and P3 of the NPPF (2026), Policies D1, D3, D4, D5, H1 and H2 of the London Plan (2021), and Policies D12.1, D12.2 and D12.3 of the Merton Local Plan (2024)</div>"
  ],
